     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce11" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>RANDOM makes this actor to choose skills randomly. Move and wait actions count as skills too. This also supports INPUT which lets player to control what skill will be chosen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
