     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce11" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>If another actor was transformed into this actor, buffs/DOTs/tokens will be removed. This is important, for example, for the final Confession boss that uses hidden tokens to track if a hero is still alive.</text:p>
